## PRIVACY INVARIANT: raw pixels/audio must never be committable, anywhere in the
## tree. These extensions are blocked globally as defense-in-depth (the egress
## guard + test enforce the same rule in code). Do NOT add negations for these.
*.mov
*.MOV
*.mp4
*.m4v
*.mkv
*.avi
*.heic
*.HEIC
*.wav
*.mp3
*.aac
*.caf
*.m4a
*.mlmodelc/
*.mlpackage/
## Note: still-image frames from capture live under data/ (ignored above);
## .jpg/.png are NOT globally blocked so genuine UI assets stay trackable.

